I arrive at the indoor sports club.
The time is now half past five on Thursday evening.
I am going to play badminton today.
There are many courts inside the club.
People are playing badminton there.
I can hear the loud sound of sports shoes.
There is also the sound of rackets hitting the shuttlecock there.
I really like to hear these sounds.
I stand there and watch the people's game.
The players run and jump quickly on the court.
I really like to play badminton.
I used to play badminton all the time in Mexico.
I can also play well like them.
I feel very excited to play again.
Now I walk to the club's office.
